+# D43 characteristic-zero lift screen at B=84
+
+**Date:** 2026-08-23
+
+**Prime:** (p=105337), residue-A fiber `a00pp`
+
+**Status:** **SOURCE-MODEL (p^2) SCREEN PASSES; STAGE 2 OPEN**
+
+## Verdict
